=== 7. The skill's example names only declared steps
$ sh main/flow-card.sh --file <S>/example.json
    Flow to agree: Know the work well enough to build it
      1. Find out what the work is about and gather the material it needs, then cut the context on the human's yes [crucible-discovery, crucible-context]
         ends with: context.cut
      2. Interview the human, a few questions at a time, until the open goal becomes recorded decisions [crucible-grill]
         ends with: grill.ended
      3. Draft the spec with the human and seal it at the approval gate [crucible-spec]
         ends with: spec.approved
    [exit 0]
